==English==

===Conjunction===
'''[[let]] [[alone]]'''

# {{idiom}} Or even; [[much less]]; to say nothing of.
#: ''I didn't even notice it, '''let alone''' care.''

====Translations====
* Czech: [[natož]]
* Finnish: [[puhumattakaan]]
* French: [[encore]] [[moins]]
* German: [[geschweige denn]]
* Italian: [[nonché]]
* Russian: [[не говоря уже о]]

====See also====
* [[not to mention]]

===Verb===
'''let alone'''

# {{transitive}} To [[leave]] alone; to stop bothering.
#: ''I wish he would '''let me alone''' so I could get some sleep.''

====Translations====
* French: [[laisser tranquille]]
* Russian: [[оставить в покое]]